# Repo-root ignores. `spark/.gitignore` covers the application; this covers the
# things that land next to it.

# Where the Claude desktop app writes files sent to the chat. They appear here
# only because this repo is the folder connected to Cowork -- they are not part
# of the project and keep re-staging themselves if left untracked.
Claude outputs/

# macOS writes one of these into every folder it has ever opened in Finder.
.DS_Store

# Increment archives that were once committed by mistake. `spark/.gitignore`
# already ignores them under spark/; this covers the root.
*.zip
